<v Sean Cole>Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. He was in the park the other day. And he jumped into this double Dutch routine with some kids. He was like, left, right, cross, turn. He was a natural. Killed it. And very proud of himself. "I mean, that's a very hard combo for most people to just drop themselves into."

